Package: photoprint
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Arrange photos on paper and print through CUPS.
 A local photo printing application built with Qt6 and CUPS.
 It supports effects, layouts, batch sheets, stickers, and text.
 It also supports papers in centimetres and keeps everything local.
